<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Saturday's English</p>
<p>premier league soccer matches:</p>
<p>Coventry 2 (Salako 57th minute, Whelan 65th) Leeds 1 (Couzens</p>
<p>1st). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 17,297.</p>
<p>Derby 1 (Asanovic 84th, penalty) Sunderland 0. 0-0. 17,692.</p>
<p>Everton 1 (Short 8th) Middlesbrough 2 (Barmby 61st, Juninho</p>
<p>81st). 1-0. 39,250.</p>
<p>Manchester United 4 (Solskjaer 22nd, Giggs 43rd, Cantona 82nd</p>
<p>and 90th, penalty) Nottingham Forest 1 (Haaland 4th). 2-1.</p>
<p>54,984.</p>
<p>Newcastle 2 (penalty, Shearer 45th, Ferdinand 61st) Blackburn 1</p>
<p>(Sutton 85th). 1-0. 36,425.</p>
<p>Southampton 0 Tottenham 1 (Armstrong 66th, penalty). 0-0.</p>
<p>15,251.</p>
<p>West Ham 0 Wimbledon 2 (Clarke 59th, Ekoku 86th). 0-0. 21,294.</p>
</text>
